: type
: Test each type caught as the standard type that it derives from
:
{{
  $* type logic_error      >'logic_error: 42'       : logic-error
  $* type invalid_argument >'invalid_argument: 42'  : invalid-argument
  $* type domain_error     >'domain_error: 42'      : domain-error
  $* type length_error     >'length_error: 42'      : length-error
  $* type out_of_range     >'out_of_range: 42'      : out-of-range
  $* type runtime_error    >'runtime_error: 42'     : runtime-error
  $* type range_error      >'range_error: 42'       : range-error
  $* type overflow_error   >'overflow_error: 42'    : overflow-error
  $* type underflow_error  >'underflow_error: 42'   : underflow-error
}}

$* literal >'unable to do it'  : literal
$* escape  >'{42}'             : escape

: computed
: Test descriptions computed at run time, which keep their braces
:
$* computed <<EOI >>EOO
invalid port {}
{{}}
EOI
invalid port {}
{{}}
EOO
